@startuml
!theme plain
|CAB| CAB
|Change_Coordinator| Change Coordinator
|Change_Requester| Change Requester
|CAB|
start
:Assess the change request;
:Check affected systems for business impact;
:Determine if change request should be approved;
:v1: Determine if change request should be approved ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = 'Yes'])
:Approve change request in current state;
:Implement approved change;
:End process after implementation;
stop
else ([v1 = 'No'])
:Evaluate if change acceptable with more information;
:Request more information from Change Coordinator;
:Send email enquiry to Change Coordinator;
:Update approval register within 3 business days;
|Change_Coordinator|
:Forward email enquiry to Change Requester;
|Change_Requester|
:Check if there are inquiries from CAB;
:v3: Check if there are inquiries from CAB ({No, Yes}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v3 = 'No'])
:No inquiries from CAB;
:End process after 3 business days;
stop
else ([v3 = 'Yes'])
|Change_Coordinator|
:Receive response from requester within 1-3 business days;
:Forward requester response to CAB for evaluation;
|CAB|
:Determine final approval of change request;
:v4: Determine final approval of change request ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v4 = 'Yes'])
:Final approval of change request;
:Implement approved change;
:End process after implementation;
stop
else ([v4 = 'No'])
:Reject change request due to unacceptability;
:End process after rejection;
stop
endif
|Change_Requester|
endif
|CAB|
endif
@enduml